From 40d5ffd638182937b5e3f1fc5976a706dd5da2a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 16:40:44 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ci(review): run the PR review's build on the self-hosted
 Linux runner

Adds pr-test.yml (workflow_dispatch only: PR number + the head SHA the
reviewer read; read-only token, no secrets, per-PR concurrency group,
self-hosted linux runner). It checks out refs/pull/<N>/head, refuses any
other head and any diff touching build.rs, .github/, scripts/, .cargo/,
a Cargo manifest or lock, or a toolchain file, trial-merges with main,
runs `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` (ui suites under
xvfb-run) and clippy on the touched crates, and writes the gate summary
to the run summary.

The PR-reviewer agent (step 2b) checks for an online runner and no cut
in progress, dispatches the run after reading the diff, waits, and
reads the per-binary result; otherwise it builds locally as before.
Cancelled, timed-out or unstarted runs are never a pass. review-prs and
AGENTS.md say so. Decisions in docs/decisions/1420-pr-test-pipeline.md.
PROCESS_VERSION 56 -> 57.

Fixes #1420

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
